  "live_art_note": "LAB23 follow-up: 2 LAB10-derived private visual FilmStrips for 27 acoustic sources and 8 OSC waveform states. Exporter in LAB23/tools; generator output local/private, no binary images added to public GitHub; 11 original backgrounds untouched. Not MPC tested.",
  "note_adsr": "LAB23 native ADSR Envelope overlay uses original LAB10 image with ONLY static curve removed. Stage handles mapped to host params 29..32. Unverified on MPC hardware; original fondos/03.png retained for reference and rollback. New PNG remains private, no public binaries.",
  "note_mod_memory": "Current LAB23 MOD page has exactly LFO1/LFO2/ENV2; no Mod Wheel. Shape-driven strips reflect existing DSP shape choices, Env2 Envelope binds four exact host parameters. MEMORY simulated buffer's selection position reflects a real parameter; visualisation is NOT a captured PCM waveform and not full time-domain animation. No DSP change.",
  "note_live_runtime": "LAB23: 6 filmstrips of 25 exact decoded MP4 frames for author-approved Solaris v09 6sec/25fps at 240x240; background matte and live playhead. LFO1/2 & MEMORY now render real engine telemetry using SDK Plotter; host parameters appended 118..123. No Mod Wheel. Hardware UI not yet verified.",
  "noise_choice": "White/Pink acoustic noise new user-approved two-way selector, host index 124. Original 11 backgrounds unchanged. Separate noise amount host index 105. Four new touch button PNGs private; their source is in LAB24 tool script."
